Ожидаемая последовательность:

```text
Start workers
      ↓
Start watcher
      ↓
Wait until all directories are registered
      ↓
Run initial scan
      ↓
Send one barrier to every partition
      ↓
Wait for all barriers
      ↓
Initial index is ready
```

